# Optional Tidal configuration.
# Leave these unset for the default browser-safe mode. The public endpoint that
# previously shipped with the app redirects and is intentionally not queried.
#
# For a proxy you control, set both values:
# VITE_TIDAL_PROXY_TARGET=https://your-tidal-proxy.example.com
# VITE_TIDAL_API_URL=/api/tidal
